        "collapsible_tab_mjEF8T": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>QuietPulse™ is a slim wrist-worn band that <strong>detects snoring the moment it starts and gently pulses — cueing your body to shift position and your airway to reopen.</strong></p><p>No mask. No mouthpiece. Nothing on your face. You don't wake up, and your partner never hears a thing.</p><ul><li>Sensors detect the <strong>sound and rhythm</strong> of snoring</li><li>Silent vibration pulses <strong>escalate gently</strong> until you shift</li><li>Companion app shows <strong>sleep, snore, and intervention data</strong> night by night</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_gBgAbF": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you need QuietPulse™",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>If you're reading this, you've probably already tried things. The strips that peel off by 2 a.m. The mouthpiece that made your jaw ache. The chin strap you refused to be seen in.</p><p>Here's why none of it stuck: those products fight the <strong>noise</strong>, or force your body into one position all night. They treat the symptom — and they're uncomfortable enough that you quit before they help.</p><p><strong>QuietPulse™ takes the opposite approach: it retrains the habit instead of muzzling it.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_akEwJj": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits 😴",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>✓ Quieter nights <strong>from the first week</strong></p><p>✓ Both of you <strong>fall asleep — and stay asleep</strong></p><p>✓ <strong>Silent for the room</strong> — felt only on your wrist</p><p>✓ Comfortable enough <strong>to forget you're wearing it</strong></p><p>✓ Ends the 3 a.m. elbow and the sofa exile</p><p>✓ <strong>Reusable every night</strong> — no refills, no consumables</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_MTCgw9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use it",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>1.</strong> Charge it with the included USB cable.</p><p><strong>2.</strong> Wear it like a watch and switch it ON.</p><p><strong>3.</strong> Sleep. It listens, nudges, and adapts — automatically.</p><p>Optional: sync the app to see your night-by-night data and tune sensitivity and pulse intensity.</p><p>Most people stop noticing the band by night two or three.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_FPPE7p": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer a guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Yes — every order is covered by a <strong>30-night money-back guarantee.</strong></p><p>Snoring has several causes, and no device can honestly promise every case. That's exactly what the guarantee is for: if your nights aren't quieter after a month in your own bed, contact us and we refund you in full. No hoops.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
